{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの登場ですこんばんわーあ('＞ω＜`)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホームページの個人写真が変わってたっ!!!\nピンクのカーディガン着させてもらって嬉しいです♪\nひめたん乃木坂の制服お気に入りなのーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったらホームページにも遊びに来てね＼(^^)／\n「乃木坂って、どこ？」って叫んで待ってるからね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えー今日は\nこの前の撮影のときのことお話しさせて下さいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/17/himeka005_2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん＊みゅうみゅう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅうみゅう好ーき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/https:/standard-webrymail.sso.biglobe.ne.jp/cgi-bin/wms.cgi/cgi-bin/wms.cgi?fn=hmimg&sid=63536323538435840303f21363f28303f22303f2273757f233972756675677f22356d6f686f2f57313233383137313131313130323&aid=00&fid=inbox&uid=798888828167525F84ZX5U365F999271X&version=30302&afmm=image/jpeg&afdir=00attach_798888828167525F84ZX5U365F999271X&afuid=01_111117_183216_______N06B_docomo_ne_jp","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の撮影はねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいい表情の作り方をいこまっち(生駒里奈chan)にレクチャーしてもらった!\nふわふわしてるオフないこまっち\nカメラの前に立った時のめーっちゃクールないこまっち\n惚れちゃいますなっ(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーそれからね\nいくたどん(生田絵梨花chan)ちーちゃん(斉藤ちはるchan)と\n乃木坂中３組でお勉強会しましたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとで写メ撮ろうって言ったまま忘れてた...\nまっまたの機会をお楽しみに(∀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりん(齋藤飛鳥chan)とかなーちゃん(西野七瀬chan)とか\nいきなりぎゅーってしてきて可愛いかったよっ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつものことだけどね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんっ\nエピソード書き出すと止まりませんっ!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほかのメンバーともいっぱいお話ししたのですが\nもっと報告したいことあるのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眠たくなってきたーあ。最近夜更かししすぎたんかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん寝てもいーい?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}